(238937, 14602, 6328, '<td valign="top">Nice.  Challenge is met.  Composition is quite good, nice idea and originality.<br/>Lighting is very good and photo is nicely focused.<br/>I think I would have gone for something other than a black frame.</td>', 'Nice.  Challenge is met.  Composition is quite good, nice idea and originality.Lighting is very good and photo is nicely focused.I think I would have gone for something other than a black frame.', '2003-03-17 12:41:54.000000', NULL, 1),
