(239591, 14847, 6328, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the light shining off your meat tenderizer at the top, it''s very distracting.<br/>The focus on the spiky part of the tenderizer is nice and sharp but you lose focus on the wood grain of the table top and the rest of the tenderizer.<br/>The lighting seems very bright, causing shadows which may be unnecessary.<br/>It''s a great idea to use this kitchen utensil, and you do meet the Challenge.</td>', 'I don''t like the light shining off your meat tenderizer at the top, it''s very distracting.The focus on the spiky part of the tenderizer is nice and sharp but you lose focus on the wood grain of the table top and the rest of the tenderizer.The lighting seems very bright, causing shadows which may be unnecessary.It''s a great idea to use this kitchen utensil, and you do meet the Challenge.', '2003-03-17 23:43:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(239593, 14779, 6328, '<td valign="top">Nice colour on the blender, good lighting also.<br/>Focus is also good.</td>', 'Nice colour on the blender, good lighting also.Focus is also good.', '2003-03-17 23:46:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(239595, 14856, 6328, '<td valign="top">Really different way to lay out your pasta.<br/>composition is nice.<br/>lighting is okay<br/>Focus is fine.<br/>coloring is okay.<br/>not much else can be said.<br/></td>', 'Really different way to lay out your pasta.composition is nice.lighting is okayFocus is fine.coloring is okay.not much else can be said.', '2003-03-17 23:47:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(239605, 14839, 6328, '<td valign="top">Composition is very good, Her Sun Tan is very good, her belly button has something in it, not sure what, nice colour to the skin, fingernails are well trimmed, nice shape to the thighs, probably does about 50 tummy sit-ups a day, recently had a shower but did not completely dried-off. But I sure love the colour and wood grain of that Pepper Mill that she''s holding!</td>', 'Composition is very good, Her Sun Tan is very good, her belly button has something in it, not sure what, nice colour to the skin, fingernails are well trimmed, nice shape to the thighs, probably does about 50 tummy sit-ups a day, recently had a shower but did not completely dried-off. But I sure love the colour and wood grain of that Pepper Mill that she''s holding!', '2003-03-17 23:53:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(239607, 14939, 5958, '<td valign="top">This is a strange photo....I had to look at it a few times as I was almost certain you had Photoshopped the shadow in....but you didn''t :)<br/> <br/>WOW!  This is a very, very cool photo.  It almost doesn''t look real (and that really adds to the photo).  Good job :)</td>', 'This is a strange photo....I had to look at it a few times as I was almost certain you had Photoshopped the shadow in....but you didn''t :) WOW!  This is a very, very cool photo.  It almost doesn''t look real (and that really adds to the photo).  Good job :)', '2003-03-17 23:55:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(239609, 14602, 5958, '<td valign="top">The colors in this are absolutely amazing....at first I didn''t like the border, but on second thought, it helps me appreciate the colors :)  great pic :)</td>', 'The colors in this are absolutely amazing....at first I didn''t like the border, but on second thought, it helps me appreciate the colors :)  great pic :)', '2003-03-17 23:56:18.000000', NULL, 1),
