(240455, 14653, 2667, '<td valign="top">Very nice image, one of my favorites this challenge. I like the warmth of the shot, and the composition is well managed. The lighting is very suiting to this subject, I think, and the grain adds a nice touch as well.</td>', 'Very nice image, one of my favorites this challenge. I like the warmth of the shot, and the composition is well managed. The lighting is very suiting to this subject, I think, and the grain adds a nice touch as well.', '2003-03-18 14:38:44.000000', NULL, 1),
