(241215, 14927, 1863, '<td valign="top">Heh, nice blender. I wish mine had all these features. I like the black and white on this. I''m not sure I like the framing. I would have cut off a tiny bit more from the left hand side to make it more symmetrical :)</td>', 'Heh, nice blender. I wish mine had all these features. I like the black and white on this. I''m not sure I like the framing. I would have cut off a tiny bit more from the left hand side to make it more symmetrical :)', '2003-03-19 07:13:41.000000', NULL, 1),
