(241341, 14739, 3080, '<td valign="top">Technically well done, however doesn''t make me want to jump out of my seat with excitement.  I like this because it''s hard to tell if these are large dishes, or small dishes.  The color is good, and the focus and clarity are also good.  no distracting shadows or bright spots.  lighting is nice.  This doesn''t go against your score, but the border is just an aweful color.  I see it was taken out of the photo, but I think I would have chosen the blue. :)  Something about your border reminds me of my great grandma''s couch.  It''s a nice shot. good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Technically well done, however doesn''t make me want to jump out of my seat with excitement.  I like this because it''s hard to tell if these are large dishes, or small dishes.  The color is good, and the focus and clarity are also good.  no distracting shadows or bright spots.  lighting is nice.  This doesn''t go against your score, but the border is just an aweful color.  I see it was taken out of the photo, but I think I would have chosen the blue. :)  Something about your border reminds me of my great grandma''s couch.  It''s a nice shot. good luck in the challenge.', '2003-03-19 10:55:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(241343, 14680, 3080, '<td valign="top">I can''t decide if the light reflections on the wisk are helpful or harmful.  The shot would be kind of boring without them, but they are a bit harsh.  I bet the focus was tricky on this one.  black and white is an excelent choice. :) I do like the angle and framing/cropping.  Looking down the list of photos, this could have been a "wisk" challenge.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I can''t decide if the light reflections on the wisk are helpful or harmful.  The shot would be kind of boring without them, but they are a bit harsh.  I bet the focus was tricky on this one.  black and white is an excelent choice. :) I do like the angle and framing/cropping.  Looking down the list of photos, this could have been a "wisk" challenge.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-03-19 10:58:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(241345, 14788, 3080, '<td valign="top">cute idea.  gives your shot kind of a 3d effect.  focus and clarity are great.  lighting is excelent.  very nice lighting on the pasta.  no distracting shadows or hot spots.  I like the angle and framing/cropping you chose for this.  very creative and original.  good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'cute idea.  gives your shot kind of a 3d effect.  focus and clarity are great.  lighting is excelent.  very nice lighting on the pasta.  no distracting shadows or hot spots.  I like the angle and framing/cropping you chose for this.  very creative and original.  good luck in the challenge.', '2003-03-19 11:01:13.000000', NULL, 1),
