(243377, 14841, 1829, '<td valign="top">I love the angle in which you chose to take this photo.  An excellent idea for the challenge.  The colour gives it an old feeling.  Lovely photo and GL.</td>', 'I love the angle in which you chose to take this photo.  An excellent idea for the challenge.  The colour gives it an old feeling.  Lovely photo and GL.', '2003-03-23 05:31:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(243378, 14940, 1829, '<td valign="top">I love this particualr photo.  Simple yet it really stands out.  I think this one stood out for me was the yellow blind.  Lovely bold colour.  Excellent photo and GL.</td>', 'I love this particualr photo.  Simple yet it really stands out.  I think this one stood out for me was the yellow blind.  Lovely bold colour.  Excellent photo and GL.', '2003-03-23 05:32:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(243379, 14809, 1829, '<td valign="top">I gave you a 7 at first for this photo, however upon looking at it more closely I see that you put a lot of thought and time in getting it right.  I really like the subject as well as the brilliant lighting technique you have chosen.  Excellent job and I''m gonna give you a 10 :)</td>', 'I gave you a 7 at first for this photo, however upon looking at it more closely I see that you put a lot of thought and time in getting it right.  I really like the subject as well as the brilliant lighting technique you have chosen.  Excellent job and I''m gonna give you a 10 :)', '2003-03-23 05:34:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(243380, 14813, 1829, '<td valign="top">You certainly have captured this shot very well as it really does feel old.  Excellent composition, well done.</td>', 'You certainly have captured this shot very well as it really does feel old.  Excellent composition, well done.', '2003-03-23 05:35:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(243470, 14839, 3102, '<td valign="top">I am BEGGING you to invite me for dinner! :) A great shot all around, I must say.  It certainly grabbed my attention, the lighting is great with the possible exception of the shadow of the arm on the right, and the sharpness is stunning.  I''m sure I''ll be adding this one to my favorites as soon as the challenge is over!  - 10<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-04-16 12:55:37.</i></td>', 'I am BEGGING you to invite me for dinner! :) A great shot all around, I must say.  It certainly grabbed my attention, the lighting is great with the possible exception of the shadow of the arm on the right, and the sharpness is stunning.  I''m sure I''ll be adding this one to my favorites as soon as the challenge is over!  - 10', '2003-03-23 12:54:40.000000', '2007-04-16 13:55:37.000000', 1),
(243471, 14672, 3102, '<td valign="top">While it''s a nice, simple composition, it could definitely benefit from a bit stronger focus.</td>', 'While it''s a nice, simple composition, it could definitely benefit from a bit stronger focus.', '2003-03-23 12:55:17.000000', NULL, 1),
