(243529, 14806, 3447, '<td valign="top">I like this photograph.  8      Non-photographic recommendation:  Treat yourself to the Screw Pull Lever - Professional Model.  Greatest cork puller in the world.</td>', 'I like this photograph.  8      Non-photographic recommendation:  Treat yourself to the Screw Pull Lever - Professional Model.  Greatest cork puller in the world.', '2003-03-23 14:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
