(243559, 14911, 3447, '<td valign="top">Not to be unkind...do trade in the wood doll for a better light.  Move subject to the left for a more classic ''Thirds'' location.</td>', 'Not to be unkind...do trade in the wood doll for a better light.  Move subject to the left for a more classic ''Thirds'' location.', '2003-03-23 16:26:21.000000', NULL, 1),
