(243654, 14842, 5112, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful picture!  Even though it looks like it''s "floating", the shadow anchors it.</td>', 'This is a beautiful picture!  Even though it looks like it''s "floating", the shadow anchors it.', '2003-03-23 18:10:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(243693, 14672, 3080, '<td valign="top">The focus here is too soft for my taste.  I think that there should at least be something in focus.  I can''t tell where the focus is here.  The background is good. nothing distracting and the lighting is also good. angle and framing/cropping are also nice.  I just wish for more focus.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'The focus here is too soft for my taste.  I think that there should at least be something in focus.  I can''t tell where the focus is here.  The background is good. nothing distracting and the lighting is also good. angle and framing/cropping are also nice.  I just wish for more focus.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-03-23 19:41:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(243694, 14374, 3080, '<td valign="top">this seems really pixeled to me.  I don''t know if this was done on purpose, but it isn''t my preference.  The focus and clarity are ok I think, but with the pixelated texture, it''s almost hard to tell.  Lighting is nice, no distracting shadows or dark spots.  I like where the shadows lay.  good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'this seems really pixeled to me.  I don''t know if this was done on purpose, but it isn''t my preference.  The focus and clarity are ok I think, but with the pixelated texture, it''s almost hard to tell.  Lighting is nice, no distracting shadows or dark spots.  I like where the shadows lay.  good luck in the challenge.', '2003-03-23 19:46:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(243698, 14692, 3080, '<td valign="top">Very nice and clear photo.  The focus and clarity are excelent.  I like the blue/purple on the mainly white surrounding.  The angle and framing/cropping are good.  I think that I may have moved the cup over to the right just a small bit to center it up.  normally, I like subjects off center, but this is one that I''d like to see right in the middle.  good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Very nice and clear photo.  The focus and clarity are excelent.  I like the blue/purple on the mainly white surrounding.  The angle and framing/cropping are good.  I think that I may have moved the cup over to the right just a small bit to center it up.  normally, I like subjects off center, but this is one that I''d like to see right in the middle.  good luck in the challenge.', '2003-03-23 19:55:49.000000', NULL, 1),
