(244108, 14608, 2667, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments everyone! Now, for a bit of silly luck with this photo... I can''t seem to reproduce the tone!!! I came across it after fiddling with desaturation, but then I saved it as this little bitty jpeg and now I can''t recreate the tone! Really kinda bums me out ''cause I''d like to offer it as a print. If anyone out there is good with toning, I''d appreciate if you would give it try. You can grab a low resolution copy at <a href="//www.pbase.com/image/14649456/original" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//www.pbase.com/image/14649456/original</a>.</td>', 'Thanks for the comments everyone! Now, for a bit of silly luck with this photo... I can''t seem to reproduce the tone!!! I came across it after fiddling with desaturation, but then I saved it as this little bitty jpeg and now I can''t recreate the tone! Really kinda bums me out ''cause I''d like to offer it as a print. If anyone out there is good with toning, I''d appreciate if you would give it try. You can grab a low resolution copy at //www.pbase.com/image/14649456/original.', '2003-03-24 02:44:52.000000', NULL, 0),
