(3720420, 14852, 61961, '<td valign="top">Your toaster photo ribboned in 2003, but it is still attracting admiration.  It''s one of my favorites on DPC, and now I''ve discovered another reason to love it: you took it with the Fuji S602Z!  It''s wonderful knowing that this little camera can produce such images.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Your toaster photo ribboned in 2003, but it is still attracting admiration.  It''s one of my favorites on DPC, and now I''ve discovered another reason to love it: you took it with the Fuji S602Z!  It''s wonderful knowing that this little camera can produce such images. ', '2007-05-31 19:21:57.000000', NULL, 0);
